al rollout date has not yet been  revealed but the xbox game pass friends  and family plan works out to roughly  ten dollars more than the current solo  plan that's priced at fifteen dollars  the plan costs 22 euros and forty nine  thousand nine hundred cop respectively  converting a current game pass ultimate  membership will have its time converted  to reflect the value of the friends and  family plan microsoft also mentioned  that subscribers can only be a member of  one group at a time and that the primary  account holder can invite up to four  people at a time with a maximum of 8  people who accept to join your account  per year only the primary account holder  can share their game pass benefits with  home sharing and group members cannot  share with other accounts on their  console another limitation to take note  of is xbox game pass friends and family  plan can only be shared with people who  live in your same region or country  comment down below who you plan on  sharing game pass with and how excited  you are for next week's cyberpunk news
 

